                    <!-- Intro script Modal -->
                    <div
                      class="modal fade"
                      id="scriptModal1"
                      tabindex="-1"
                      aria-labelledby="scriptModalLabel"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl">
                        <div class="modal-content">
                          <div class="modal-header">
                            <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="scriptModalLabel">
                              Introduction
                            </h1>
                            <button
                              type="button"
                              class="btn-close"
                              data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                              aria-label="Close"
                            ></button>
                          </div>
                          <div class="modal-body">
                            "Hi, welcome to our assignment of accountability
                            system or AOA for short. This is a great system that
                            you're going to find very, very helpful as you think
                            through your job role and responsibilities. The
                            assignment of accountability is built with the
                            purpose of helping to clarify your role, to
                            establish your accountabilities and also to identify
                            things like your goals and metrics and the ways in
                            which you can perform better in your job. You'll
                            start by answering some simple questions like your
                            name and your title and you'll go on to a few more
                            complicated things, for example what you&apos;re
                            accountable for. This should probably take you about
                            an hour to fill out, but you can do it in phases if
                            you like. Please feel free to watch each
                            section&apos;s intro video to learn more about that
                            section, there are even transcripts available for
                            you if you'd like to look at those while you're
                            filling out questions. It will be very good for you
                            to think through your answers thoroughly and
                            exactly, don&apos;t overthink it either. Ironically,
                            often your very first thoughts are the ones that
                            matter the most. So join in with the assignment of
                            accountability, by going through each question one
                            at a time. Let&apos;s get started now with inputting
                            your name and your title, your exact title into the
                            form. Thank you very much."
